+        - Write $\mathbf{I}_{color}[x, y] = \mathbf{C}_k$.
+        - Write $\mathbf{I}_{label}[x, y] = \mathbf{L}_k$.
+        - Write $\mathbf{I}_{idx}[x, y] = k$.
